+## Overview
+
+Total revenue across 30 orders was $7,154.44, with a median order value of
+$204.94. Orders range from $47.50 to $598.00.
+
+## Top Products
+
+Gadget leads all products with $2,392.00 in revenue, followed by Widget at
+$2,118.94. Doohickey ($1,513.00) and Sprocket ($1,130.50) trail behind, so
+the top two products account for most of the sales total.
+
+## Regional Performance
+
+North is the strongest region at $2,176.35, with East close behind at
+$1,830.79. South contributed $1,732.48, while West is the weakest region at
+$1,414.82, well below the others.
+
+## Recommendations
+
+- Promote Gadget and Widget bundles, since these two products drive the largest share of revenue.
+- Investigate West region's low sales and test targeted marketing to close the gap with North.
+- Encourage larger orders above the $204.94 median through volume discounts on Sprocket and Doohickey.
